WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.104
Hi, my name is Eric and I am a current
senior studying Business Administration

2
00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:05.939
at Carnegie Mellon University.

3
00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:09.209
During my first year, I lived in Scobell
which was a residence hall

4
00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:12.212
located in the Hill neighborhood.

5
00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:14.981
The university makes a really easy
to transition

6
00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:17.984
to living on your own
as a first year student.

7
00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:20.186
They set up everything really conveniently

8
00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.789
so that you have an appropriate meal plan.

9
00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:26.726
The RAs are really friendly
and they make sure to make everyone feel involved.

10
00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.328
and as part of a community,.

11
00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:31.765
The RAs host events every now and then

12
00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.535
to build community
and foster a cohesive spirit.

13
00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:41.903
Some of these activities can include
friendship bracelet making or s'mores nights.

14
00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:46.079
My RA even took us to go
see a private screening

15
00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.481
of a movie when it just released.

16
00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:52.018
And one time the University
sent us March Madness tickets

17
00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:54.687
so we were all
able to go as part of a floor.

